@prefix skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#> .
@prefix dcterms: <http://purl.org/dc/terms/> .

<https://www.glossarist.org/dpp/dataset/dpp/concept/dpp-0138>
  a skos:Concept ;
  skos:notation "dpp-0138" ;
  skos:prefLabel "proof of binding"@eng ;
  skos:definition "salted cryptographic commitment to the parent, recorded in the child's event log, by which a child satisfies the bidirectional parent-knowledge requirement without disclosing the identity of the parent"@eng ;
  skos:scopeNote "Proof of binding is distinct from knowledge of parent: verifiable modes establish that the child is validly installed in some parent under a given profile (warranty, compliance) without revealing which parent; full disclosure occurs only by ceremony."@eng ;
  skos:scopeNote "An optional escrow envelope under a threshold trustee (concept dpp-0137) accompanies the commitment where future disclosure must remain possible."@eng
 .